{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>pixel art 2D platformer</strong>, you will help Rem\u00a0collect all of her records as her stats and abilitities are constantly being remixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persist through each level over and over again while your speed, abilities, time limit, scenery, and more constantly change around you. Victory only comes when you have mastered each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Rem</strong>, who holds the world's biggest record collection, but she somehow lost <i>ALL</i> of them! She goes off on a quest throughout her Cyber City to reclaim all of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/RemIdleStorePage.gif?t=1743635075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore over<strong> 5</strong>\u00a0<strong>unique areas</strong> and talk with strange people to find out where all the records went, and how they were lost in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/NewTilesetAreaMockup.png?t=1743635075\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter <strong><i>dangeous foes</i></strong> who may have deeper reasons to be stopping you from retrieving all of the records...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450190?t=1743635075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450190?t=1743635075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/c3b1a5d18368ea61d61eb399a52f54b3606603f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1